# TypeShala — files excluded from the Vercel deployment.
#
# This project deploys as a flat static site (the whole repo root is
# the web root, no build step) — moving a file to a subfolder like
# docs/ does NOT stop Vercel from serving it publicly by itself; only
# this ignore file does that. Both were done together deliberately:
# docs/ for organization, this file for actually keeping it out of
# the deployed bundle.

# Historical/legacy SQL setup scripts — superseded by the current
# mock_test_results-based schema; kept for reference only.
docs/legacy/

# SQL migration snippets and Markdown design notes — reference
# material for maintainers, not needed by the browser at runtime.
docs/notes/
